{"alias":"/learning/cte/resources/schemas","title":"Schemas","changed":"2026-04-06T23:15:26+00:00","before":"<p>As part of Maine DOE's CTE's Mini-Grant series, a team of educators and OSHA experts worked together to design and produce safety schemas. The grant's goal was to create a sample safety library to assist schools in aligning to MRSA Title 26 and the adopted OSHA standards located in 29 CFR 1910. Such alignment allows a CTE school to be better equipped to seek the Safety and Health Award for Public Employers (SHAPE). SHAPE recognizes public sector employers who maintain an exemplary safety and health management system. Acceptance into SHAPE by the Maine Department of Labor, Bureau of Labor Standards is an achievement that distinguishes an organization as a model for workplace safety and health. Upon receiving SHAPE recognition, CTE schools are exempt from programmed inspections during the period the SHAPE certification is valid.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The documents below are the samples developed for CTE schools. Feel free to customize each schema for the intended school.</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"a046de4b-a0fd-4242-be13-bdf8102d4f31\" filename=\"CTE - Safety Schemas Health and Safety - 02.18.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Health%20and%20Safety%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"CTE Safety Health\">CTE Safety and Health</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"f20d8d76-51ce-490d-8cfb-e6b15254bac0\" filename=\"CTE - Safety Schemas Air Compressor - 02.18.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Air%20Compressor%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"Air Compressor\">Air Compressor</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"89550044-7a87-403b-baea-8d24055e0b50\" filename=\"CTE - Safety Schemas Asbestos - 02.18.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Asbestos%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"Asbestos\">Asbestos and Custodial Staff</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"6b567d5b-1e51-4c25-b995-efbfb6169e76\" filename=\"CTE - Safety Schemas Bloodborne Pathogens - 3.19.2025.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Bloodborne%20Pathogens%20-%203.19.2025.pdf\">Bloodborne Pathogens</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"ba491994-2603-4134-a4ce-fe2f3e3bae3a\" filename=\"CTE - Safety Schemas Confined Space - 02.18.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Confined%20Space%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"confined\">Confined Space Permit</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"9a63847c-61b1-40d5-893f-d22f73bd168b\" filename=\"CTE - Safety Schemas Cutting and Welding - 02.18.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Cutting%20and%20Welding%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"cutting\">Cutting and Welding</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"f0e02c67-8e4b-4801-b659-dfb2aeeaed0d\" filename=\"CTE - Safety Schemas Emergency Shower and Eyewash - 02.18.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Emergency%20Shower%20and%20Eyewash%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"emergency\">Emergency Shower and Eyewash</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"0f17aa20-971f-419c-92d4-508458ea80bb\" filename=\"CTE - Safety Schemas First Aid - 02.18.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20First%20Aid%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"fire extinguisher\">Fire Extinguisher Protection</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20First%20Aid%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\">First Aid&nbsp;</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"5bd77b2c-82f0-48be-b1dc-04f1914ecdd1\" filename=\"CTE - Safety Schemas Flammable Liquids - 02.18.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Flammable%20Liquids%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"flammable\">Flammable Liquids</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"cb936684-f3b0-4c65-b663-555025b181b3\" filename=\"CTE - Safety Schemas Forklift - 02.18.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Forklift%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"forklift\">Forklift</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"8adc5f8b-85ec-430c-a8bf-69930762c883\" filename=\"CTE - Safety Schemas Globally Harmonized System - 02.18.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Globally%20Harmonized%20System%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"global\">Global/Globally Harmonized System (GHS)</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"33f0c13e-feef-409b-93e4-ae11ae4d06c9\" filename=\"CTE - Safety Schemas Hearing Conservation - 02.18.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Hearing%20Conservation%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"hearing\">Hearing Conservation</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"f0ff6c5a-7a06-4293-a52a-9ef6b28388d0\" filename=\"CTE - Safety Schemas Jack and Jack Stand - 02.18.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Jack%20and%20Jack%20Stand%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"jack\">Jack/Jack Stand</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"7506a0a9-3304-44fc-8e49-26c3a166cd58\" filename=\"CTE - Safety Schemas Ladder - 02.18.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Ladder%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"ladder\">Ladder</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"bf0fd1c0-e4b3-4355-a04d-3dbbbdcfb71c\" filename=\"CTE - Safety Schemas Lift and Hoist - 02.18.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Lift%20and%20Hoist%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"lift\">Lift/Hoist</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"caefbc02-9452-44cc-8f13-b0624152539d\" filename=\"CTE - Safety Schemas Power and Hand Tools - 02.18.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Power%20and%20Hand%20Tools%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"power\">Power/Hand Tool</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"c72780b5-2303-4267-849e-520b32129bff\" filename=\"CTE - Safety Schemas Respiratory Protection - 02.18.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Respiratory%20Protection%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"respiratory\">Respiratory Protection</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"056c30d5-29de-4e4e-8dd8-c61be049ecc3\" filename=\"CTE - Safety Schemas Sprinkler System - 02.18.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Sprinkler%20System%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"sprinkler\">Sprinkler System</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"9c5e78e7-27ae-489e-968c-f324f48ff34d\" filename=\"CTE - Safety Schemas Walking Surfaces - 02.18.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Walking%20Surfaces%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"walking\">Walking Surfaces</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"contact-cube\"><strong>Shawn Lagasse</strong><br>\r\n<em>CTE Consultant, Education Specialist III</em><br>\r\n<strong>Phone:&nbsp;</strong>207-624-6743<br>\r\n<strong>Email:</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:shawn.lagasse@maine.gov\" tabindex=\"-1\">shawn.lagasse@maine.gov</a><br>\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero\">\n<p class=\"doe-eyebrow\">Resources - Career and Technical Education</p>\n<p class=\"doe-contact-link\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n<p class=\"doe-lead\">As part of Maine DOE's CTE's Mini-Grant series, a team of educators and OSHA experts worked together to design and produce safety schemas. The grant's goal was to create a sample safety library to assist schools in aligning to MRSA Title 26 and the adopted OSHA standards located in 29 CFR 1910. Such alignment allows a CTE school to be better equipped to seek the Safety and Health Award for Public Employers (SHAPE). SHAPE recognizes public sector employers who maintain an exemplary safety and health management system. Acceptance into SHAPE by the Maine Department of Labor, Bureau of Labor Standards is an achievement that distinguishes an organization as a model for workplace safety and health. Upon receiving SHAPE recognition, CTE schools are exempt from programmed inspections during the period the SHAPE certification is valid.</p>\n\n</div>\n\r\n\r\n<p>The documents below are the samples developed for CTE schools. Feel free to customize each schema for the intended school.</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Health%20and%20Safety%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"CTE Safety Health\">CTE Safety and Health</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Air%20Compressor%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"Air Compressor\">Air Compressor</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Asbestos%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"Asbestos\">Asbestos and Custodial Staff</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Bloodborne%20Pathogens%20-%203.19.2025.pdf\">Bloodborne Pathogens</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Confined%20Space%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"confined\">Confined Space Permit</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Cutting%20and%20Welding%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"cutting\">Cutting and Welding</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Emergency%20Shower%20and%20Eyewash%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"emergency\">Emergency Shower and Eyewash</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20First%20Aid%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"fire extinguisher\">Fire Extinguisher Protection</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20First%20Aid%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\">First Aid</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Flammable%20Liquids%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"flammable\">Flammable Liquids</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Forklift%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"forklift\">Forklift</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Globally%20Harmonized%20System%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"global\">Global/Globally Harmonized System (GHS)</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Hearing%20Conservation%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"hearing\">Hearing Conservation</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Jack%20and%20Jack%20Stand%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"jack\">Jack/Jack Stand</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Ladder%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"ladder\">Ladder</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Lift%20and%20Hoist%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"lift\">Lift/Hoist</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Power%20and%20Hand%20Tools%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"power\">Power/Hand Tool</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Respiratory%20Protection%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"respiratory\">Respiratory Protection</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Sprinkler%20System%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"sprinkler\">Sprinkler System</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Walking%20Surfaces%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf\" title=\"walking\">Walking Surfaces</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"contact\" class=\"contact-cube\">\n<p><strong>Shawn Lagasse</strong><br>\r\n<em>CTE Consultant, Education Specialist III</em><br>\r\n<strong>Phone:&nbsp;</strong>207-624-6743<br>\r\n<strong>Email:</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:shawn.lagasse@maine.gov\">Shawn.Lagasse@maine.gov</a>\r\n&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\n<p class=\"doe-jump\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n<p class=\"doe-top\"><a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a></p>","notes":[],"decisions":[{"id":"emailcase","on":true,"label":"Write the email addresses the same way","why":"1 address is shown in whatever case it was typed in. The house form capitalises each name and leaves a middle initial in lower case — shawn.lagasse@maine.gov → Shawn.Lagasse@maine.gov. Only the first letter of each part changes, so a name that spells itself LaBreck keeps doing so.","value":"1 address"},{"id":"deck","on":true,"label":"Use this paragraph as the page description","why":"It is the page’s own opening paragraph, moved into the banner rather than rewritten.","value":"As part of Maine DOE's CTE's Mini-Grant series, a team of educators and OSHA experts worked together to design and produce safety schemas. The grant's goal was to create a sample safety library to assist schools in aligning to MRSA Title 26 and the adopted OSHA standards located in 29 CFR 1910. Such alignment allows a CTE school to be better equipped to seek the Safety and Health Award for Public Employers (SHAPE). SHAPE recognizes public sector employers who maintain an exemplary safety and health management system. Acceptance into SHAPE by the Maine Department of Labor, Bureau of Labor Standards is an achievement that distinguishes an organization as a model for workplace safety and health. Upon receiving SHAPE recognition, CTE schools are exempt from programmed inspections during the period the SHAPE certification is valid."},{"id":"eyebrow","on":true,"label":"Eyebrow: \"Resources - Career and Technical Education\"","why":"Taken from the parent page, /learning/cte/resources."}],"mechanical":["drupal entity attrs stripped: 77","loose text wrapped in a paragraph: 1","line breaks at the edge of a block removed: 1","action links marked: 20","space moved out of a link: 1"],"findings":[],"safe":true,"audit":{"alias":"/learning/cte/resources/schemas","title":"Schemas","changed":"2026-04-06T23:15:26+00:00","words":213,"bytes":8901,"fixes":["drupal entity attrs stripped: 77","loose text wrapped in a paragraph: 1","line breaks at the edge of a block removed: 1","action links marked: 20","space moved out of a link: 1"],"flags":["no section-header device"],"contentSafe":true,"headings":[],"outline":[],"components":{"cards":0,"cardHeaders":0,"cardTitles":0,"accordions":0,"tables":0,"dataTables":0,"contactCube":1,"jumbotron":0,"dcNote":0,"blockheads":0,"videos":0,"images":0,"buttons":0},"access":{"imagesNoAlt":0,"vagueLinkText":[],"emptyLinks":0,"tablesNoScope":0,"multipleH1":0,"inlineColour":0},"links":{"internal":[],"files":["/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Health%20and%20Safety%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf","/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Safety%20Schemas%20Air%20Compressor%20-%2002.18.2024.pdf","/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/file